 events(){return html`${this.heading('事件中心','统一处理资源告警与 Slide 平台异常，保留事件、调查和恢复证据。',this.btn('打开 AI 工作空间',()=>this.openWorkspace()))}${this.tabs(['活动告警','聚合事件','通知投递','平台异常'],this.eventTab,v=>{this.eventTab=v;this.query='';this.requestUpdate();})}${this.eventTab==='活动告警'?this.problems(true):this.eventTab==='平台异常'?html`<div class="summary-strip"><span><strong class="bad">${this.platformRecovered?0:1}</strong>未恢复异常</span><span><strong>${this.platformAnalyzed?1:0}</strong>已完成分析</span><span><strong>1</strong>关联调查</span></div>${this.table([['severity','严重度'],['title','平台异常'],['component','组件'],['time','发生时间'],['state','故障状态'],['investigation','调查状态'],['actions','操作']],[{severity:this.badge('错误'),title:html`<a class="entity-name" href="#platform-event">采集任务重试增加</a><div class="micro mono">S-20261022-0042 · QUEUE_RETRY_EXHAUSTED</div>`,component:'队列 / 采集器',time:'10:35:12',state:this.badge(this.platformRecovered?'已恢复':'待验证'),investigation:this.platformAnalyzed?'分析完成 · 等待复测':'待分析',actions:html`<button class="btn-ghost btn-sm" @click=${()=>this.go('platform-event')}>查看异常</button>`}])}<div class="note section-gap">异常事实先留存，再关联调查。分析结束不表示故障恢复；无事件也不能证明平台健康。</div>`:this.eventTab==='聚合事件'?html`<app-card><span slot="header">聚合事件 · 待处理视图</span><div class="action-row"><div><strong>订单库连接压力</strong><p class="micro">mysql-order-prod · 关联连接使用率告警 · ${this.ack?'调查中':'待处理'}</p></div><button class="btn" @click=${()=>this.go('problem')}>打开原事件</button></div><p class="micro section-gap">原“关注事项”的待处理事件视图收敛在这里，不创建第二套事件状态。</p></app-card>`:html`<app-card><span slot="header">通知投递记录</span><p>按事件查看发送结果、失败原因与回执；收件人、路由和升级复用现有统一通知配置，不在此重复维护。</p>${this.table([['time','发送时间'],['event','事件'],['channel','渠道'],['recipient','接收对象'],['result','投递结果'],['receipt','回执 / 原因']],[{time:'10:36:12',event:'P-20261022-0138',channel:'邮件',recipient:'数据库值班组',result:'成功 · 演示',receipt:'demo-receipt-0138'},{time:'10:35:18',event:'S-20261022-0042',channel:'Webhook',recipient:'平台值班组',result:'失败 · 演示',receipt:'请求超时 · 未证明送达'}])}<p class="micro section-gap">固定样例，不发送真实通知；投递失败不改变原事件状态。</p></app-card>`}`;}
